# Organic Maps MD3 redesign

This repository contains a Material Design 3 redesign of the Organic Maps
interface: design tokens, component specifications, an interactive prototype
and platform-specific token implementations.

Organic Maps is a free and open-source offline maps application powered by
OpenStreetMap data — https://organicmaps.app

## Attribution

If you use this design in a product, please credit the Organic Maps
Project with a visible mention and a link to https://organicmaps.app

## Third-party components

- Design tokens follow the Material Design 3 specification by Google LLC,
  published under Apache License 2.0.
- The type family referenced by the design is Inter (SIL Open Font License).
  The prototype loads Inter from Google Fonts; no font binaries are
  redistributed in this repository.
- Map geometry in the prototype is procedurally generated for illustration
  only and is not derived from OpenStreetMap data.

